{"type":"text","timestamp":1794589961831,"sessionID":"ses_e2a1c240fffexkkiB53DGo0HVn","part":{"id":"prt_1d5e5a0e8001GaINZ9xyp4rxUP","sessionID":"ses_e2a1c240fffexkkiB53DGo0HVn","messageID":"msg_1d5e595d1001O2yw1xjCarTNSJ","type":"text","text":"T020 done. One file changed, both specified sentences added to the `run-command-behaviour.mjs` row in `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md`.\n\n**Verify output** (run from the repository root, `RA` set to that file):\n\n```\n--- rg -o mixed_row_arms | wc -l\n       2\n--- rg -c 'folder its prompt named'\n1\nexit=0\n```\n\nBefore the edit the same two checks returned `0` and no match (exit 1), so the change is what moved them.\n\nWhat I added:\n\n1. After ``optional `--arm`, `--fixture` and `--dry-run`.`` in the row's opening paragraph: the `g2` / `pre` / `mixed_row_arms` arm rule, the per-line `fixture` record, and the `g2-fixture` backfill fallback.\n2. After ``a checkout without the arena builder's marker (`arena_unprepared`),`` in the exit-2 list: `a selection that mixes started-command rows with others (`mixed_row_arms`),`.\n\nThe row is still a single table line, and the added prose holds no em dash and no semicolon. The checkbox in `tasks.md` is unticked, as instructed. Nothing was committed, and I did not revert or touch the other concurrent edits visible in this file (`score-command-transcripts.mjs`, `command-offer.mjs` rows and the `untrusted_checkout` paragraph belong to T016 to T019 and T021 workers).\n\nNothing was blocked and nothing was left undone.","time":{"start":1794589958376,"end":1794589961831}}}
